title: 9. The plan is the one record; missions, readings and reports link to it and never copy it. Only its owner and Top write in it.
pid: 752bfac7-f40b-451e-8ef1-fe4852dc1b0f
body: |2-
  A builder that cannot write the plan ends its report with a headline
  "For the plan": the lines to put where, saying the part is built
  (commits, the check and what it printed) and amending any decision.
  Top puts them in when it reads the report. Built, the plan says
  'built' and stays as the record of why; a decision changed later is
  edited where it stands, with when and why. Each owner whose
  territory the plan changed links it from its map.
  Why, and its sources: [[id:0aa940c0-0ca2-42b4-966c-ddd3da23761a][step 9, its reasons]].
